    "name": "A transaction pays every fee rule it matches",
    "slug": "a_transaction_pays_every_fee_rule_it_matches",
    "description": "A transaction can match several fee rules. Its fee is the SUM over all matching rules of (fixed_amount + rate * eur_amount / 10000), not the first, lowest-id, cheapest or most specific rule. A total for a merchant and period is the sum over all its transactions and all their matching rules. Transactions that match no rule pay nothing.",
